{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778537064346,"sessionID":"ses_1e706c893ffe376YfIpiZU2ond","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"task","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-ae9a358a123e6938","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"Plan for Southern tick-associated rash illness term creation","description":"Plan the creation of a new MONDO term for \"Southern tick-associated rash illness\" including research, design patterns, identifier validation, and final check-in.","prompt":"Plan the creation of a new MONDO term for \"Southern tick-associated rash illness\". \nDetails:\n- Label: Southern tick-associated rash illness\n- Synonyms: STARI, Masters disease\n- Definition: An infectious disease causing acute manifestations similar to those of Lyme disease. Its vector is the lone star tick, Amblyomma americanum.\n- PMIDs: 19522220, 36116832, 40267428\n- Parent term: MONDO:0025294 tick-borne infectious disease\n- ORCID: https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5705-7831\n- Additional refs: NCIT:C128427, SNOMED:444100007\n\nPlease provide a detailed plan including research, design pattern identification, term creation, identifier validation, and final check-in/normalization steps.","subagent_type":"general"},"output":"task_id: ses_1e6f4ee86ffeZflLCxcxXvcXSw (for resuming to continue this task if needed)\n\n<task_result>\nI will follow this plan to create the new MONDO term for \"Southern tick-associated rash illness\":\n\n### 1. Research & Evidence Synthesis\n*   **Agent**: `deep-research-specialist`\n*   **Action**: Analyze provided PMIDs (19522220, 36116832, 40267428) to refine the definition, verify clinical manifestations, and confirm the vector (*Amblyomma americanum*).\n\n### 2. Design Pattern & Identifier Validation\n*   **Agents**: `design-pattern-advisor` and `identifier-validator`\n*   **Action**: \n    *   Identify the most appropriate design pattern for vector-borne infectious diseases.\n    *   Validate the parent term `MONDO:0025294` and external references `NCIT:C128427`, `SNOMED:444100007`.\n    *   Verify PMIDs for contextual appropriateness.\n\n### 3. Term Creation\n*   **Action**:\n    *   Generate a new ID (`MONDO:777xxxx`) and check for clashes in `src/ontology/mondo-edit.obo`.\n    *   Create a new stanza file in `terms/` containing:\n        *   **ID/Name**: `MONDO:777xxxx`, \"Southern tick-associated rash illness\".\n        *   **Synonyms**: \"STARI\", \"Masters disease\" (with proper citations).\n        *   **Definition**: Refined text with citations from the research phase.\n        *   **Axioms**: `is_a: MONDO:0025294` with source attribution.\n        *   **Xrefs**: NCIT and SNOMED IDs.\n        *   **Metadata**: ORCID curator and issue tracker link.\n\n### 4. Quality Assurance & Integration\n*   **Agents**: `metadata-checker` and `odk`\n*   **Action**:\n    *   Validate metadata compliance using `metadata-checker`.\n    *   Check in the term using `obo-checkin.pl`.\n    *   Normalize the ontology: `sh run.sh make NORM && mv NORM mondo-edit.obo`.\n    *   Perform final syntax validation using `robot convert`.\n</task_result>","metadata":{"sessionId":"ses_1e6f4ee86ffeZflLCxcxXvcXSw","model":{"modelID":"google/gemma-4-31B-it","providerID":"togetherai"},"truncated":false},"title":"Plan the creation of a new MONDO term for \"Southern tick-associated rash illness\" including research, design patterns, identifier validation, and final check-in.","time":{"start":1778536616331,"end":1778537064342}},"id":"prt_e190a9421001Z6yB9EUS7xmiF2","sessionID":"ses_1e706c893ffe376YfIpiZU2ond","messageID":"msg_e1907e46d001Vk3TUhExMyDr2n"}}
